      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The traditional nuclear family is the only proven blueprint for raising resilient, moral children because it provides the stable, unified guidance that modern fragmented households simply cannot match.\nYour campaign should boldly declare that two parents and one home create the unshakeable foundation kids need to thrive in a chaotic world, rejecting any notion that alternative structures offer equal security.\nStop watering down the message with \"maybe\" or \"some people think\"—stand firm that this is the biological and social reality that builds the strongest future generations.",
